OL,3,AChristmas toy rush being driven by
OL,4,Asquishies and building sets
OL,5,
OL,6,FTraditional games, squishies and
OL,7,Fbuilding sets are helping to drive a
OL,8,Fbumper year for toy sales, figures
OL,9,Fshow.
OL,11,FThe data comes ahead of the crucial
OL,12,FChristmas run-in for retailers, which
OL,13,Fpeaks at 23 toys sold every second in
OL,14,Fthe UK.
OL,16,FThe number of toys sold up to October
OL,17,Fwas 17% higher than the same period
OL,18,Flast year and growth is at a 10-year
OL,19,Fhigh, according to research company
OL,20,FCircana.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
