OL,3,AChristmas toy rush being driven by
OL,4,Asquishies and building sets
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe increase comes despite consumers'
OL,7,Fcost-of-living pressures, and there are
OL,8,Fsigns that some of the biggest growth
OL,9,Fin sales is for toys priced between #5
OL,10,Fand #10.
